#NEXUS

[ norman2011a_fig41: Ornithischian tree with outgroups, read by eye; fully resolved, no clade names printed. 14 tips, fully resolved. Sample 6 case (census 2 extended to draw 120, seed 20261231). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

